<section class="auth-brand" aria-hidden="true">
  <p class="auth-eyebrow"><span class="logo-mark">D</span>공모전 일정관리</p>
  <h1 class="auth-headline">마감은 놓치지 않고,<br>준비는 한눈에.</h1>
  <p class="auth-lead">공고 링크만 붙여 넣으면 마감일까지 자동으로 채워져요.<br>D-day와 체크리스트로 준비 상황을 한 화면에서 챙기세요.</p>

  <div class="preview">
    <div class="preview-row">
      <span class="dday-tile dday-urgent">D-2</span>
      <span class="preview-main">
        <strong>어촌 창업 아이디어 공모전</strong>
        <span class="progress"><span class="progress-bar" style="width: 60%"></span></span>
      </span>
      <span class="preview-pct">60%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="preview-row">
      <span class="dday-tile dday-soon">D-5</span>
      <span class="preview-main">
        <strong>청년 정책 제안 공모전</strong>
        <span class="progress"><span class="progress-bar" style="width: 50%"></span></span>
      </span>
      <span class="preview-pct">50%</span>
    </div>
    <div class="preview-row">
      <span class="dday-tile">D-9</span>
      <span class="preview-main">
        <strong>공공데이터 활용 공모전</strong>
        <span class="progress"><span class="progress-bar" style="width: 25%"></span></span>
      </span>
      <span class="preview-pct">25%</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul class="auth-features">
    <li><span class="feature-icon"><%- icon('sparkles', 16) %></span>링크로 자동 입력</li>
    <li><span class="feature-icon"><%- icon('calendar', 16) %></span>월별 마감 달력</li>
    <li><span class="feature-icon"><%- icon('table', 16) %></span>엑셀처럼 표로 보기</li>
  </ul>
</section>
